    <string name="native_labs_printer_title" formatted="false">Press</string>
    <string name="native_labs_printer_body" formatted="false">Projects as documents: chat answers, headings, notes and drawings, saved as a PDF.</string>
    <string name="native_labs_printer_about" formatted="false">Each project is its own document. The white page is what the PDF prints: A4, made offline on this phone. Tap a block to move it, edit it or remove it. Answers come from a chat, and every document ends with how it was made: the date, the models and their speed, each drawing\'s recipe and one numbered list of the sources.</string>
