    <string name="native_labs_printer_howTo" formatted="false">Add answers from a chat: under an answer, open the plugins and tap Add to Press. Or add a heading, a note, a photo or a drawing.</string>
    <string name="native_labs_printer_noImages" formatted="false">No drawings yet. Make some in Designer, then pick them here.</string>
